Package: xios-sdl-smoke
Version: @DEB_XIOS_SDL_SMOKE_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: X11/Wayland Apps
Priority: optional
Depends: libsdl2-2.0-0, libsdl3-0, angle, libwayland0, libxkbcommon0, libpulse0
Description: SDL Wayland GLES smoke clients for Xios
 Two small signed clients that exercise the SDL2 and SDL3 Wayland backends
 through Xios's ANGLE/EGL to IOSurface rendering path. They provide a durable
 runtime gate for game ports before large engines and data sets are packaged.
